@segment 1-6 Northshire Valley
@start-level 1
# Human Mage 1-6. Northshire Abbey is the hub in the middle: wolves and kobold vermin north and west of it,
# the vineyard (Defias) south-east across the river, Echo Ridge Mine in the north.
# Order follows TUGs' Northshire file in our own words, with one change: Skirmish at Echo Ridge and The Big
# Picture are done in ONE trip into the mine (TUGs goes in twice).
# New Forever quests (the stolen-books chain 91741 -> 91743 -> 91745 -> 91752 -> 91758 -> 91772, Book
# Inventory 92124, the camping lead-in 96627) are placed from the ForeverChanges pages.
# The Big Picture 91752 is flagged ELITE on its page ("find a friend"). TUGs does it solo without comment and the
# rest of the books chain hangs on it, so it is in the route with a warning and a way out.
# Left out: 5805 Welcome! (Collector's Edition voucher only).
# Hearthstone: bound in Northshire, used once (back from the vineyard).
# Carry-out: 54 Report to Goldshire, 91772 Shhh! We're Hunting Kobolds, 96627 The Adventurer, 2158 Rest and
# Relaxation (all handed in at Goldshire, next segment).

# --- First steps at the abbey ---
A 783 | Deputy Willem stands in front of you, outside Northshire Abbey
T 783 | Marshal McBride, just inside the abbey door
A 7 | Marshal McBride
A 5261 | Deputy Willem, back outside
T 5261 | Eagan Peltskinner, round the left (west) side of the abbey
A 33 | Eagan Peltskinner
C 33 | Young Wolves (level 1) run on the grass west and south-west of the abbey, Timber Wolves (2) north of it: collect 8 Tough Wolf Meat. Cast Fireball from as far away as you can and keep casting
C 7 | Kobold Vermin (1-2) camp just north of the abbey: kill 10
A 91741 @ Elwynn Forest, 49.2, 36.3 | One of the vermin drops a Nibbled-On Book. Right-click it in your bags to start the quest. No book after the ten kills? Kill a few more until it drops
T 33 | Eagan Peltskinner
T 7 | Marshal McBride, inside the abbey
A 15 | Marshal McBride
A 3104 | Marshal McBride: your mage letter
T 3104 | Khelden Bremen, the mage trainer, inside the abbey (follow the arrow)
TRAIN @ Elwynn Forest, 49.7, 39.4 | Khelden Bremen: learn everything he offers (Arcane Intellect), then buff yourself. Come back to him at levels 4 and 6
T 91741 | Brother Paxton, in the abbey's library
A 92124 | Brother Paxton
T 92124 | Daniel, his assistant, a few steps away. He talks about professions: none are needed for this route
A 91743 | Brother Paxton. The Stolen Books drop from every kobold in the valley: you fill this over the next kobold quests

# --- The vineyard, first trip ---
A 18 | Deputy Willem, outside the abbey (needs level 2)
C 18 | Northshire Vineyards, south-east across the stone bridge: Defias Thugs (3-4) stand between the vine rows. Collect 12 Red Burlap Bandanas. They are close together: pull the one at the edge, and eat between fights
T 18 | Deputy Willem
A 6 | Deputy Willem. Garrick comes on your second trip to the vineyard
A 3903 | Deputy Willem
T 3903 | Milly Osworth, beside the barn on the east side of the abbey
A 3904 | Milly Osworth
TRAIN @ Elwynn Forest, 49.7, 39.4 | Khelden Bremen: level 4 spells (Frostbolt, Conjure Water). From now on make your own water. Frostbolt slows the target: open with it and most things die before they reach you. Not 4 yet? Come back after the next kobolds

# --- Echo Ridge, outside the mine ---
C 15,91743 | Kobold Workers (3) stand around the entrance of Echo Ridge Mine, north of the abbey: kill 10 and loot every kobold for Stolen Books. Stay outside the mine for now
T 15 | Marshal McBride
A 21 | Marshal McBride. You do it together with the next books quest
TRAIN @ Elwynn Forest, 49.7, 39.4 | Khelden Bremen: level 4 spells if you did not have them yet

# --- The vineyard, second trip ---
C 3904 | Back over the bridge to the vineyard: pick up 8 crates of Milly's Harvest (the grape buckets between the vine rows)
C 6 | Garrick Padfoot (level 5) stands at the shack on the east edge of the vineyard with two Thugs beside him. Kill the Thugs one at a time first if you can pull them alone; then Garrick from full mana, Frostbolt from maximum range. Loot his head
H Northshire Valley | Your hearthstone is bound at the abbey. On cooldown? It is a one-minute walk
T 3904 | Milly Osworth
A 3905 | Milly Osworth
T 6 | Deputy Willem
T 3905 | Brother Neals, in the abbey's side room with the wine casks (follow the arrow)

# --- Echo Ridge Mine ---
C 91743 @ Elwynn Forest, 48.9, 34.6 | Still short of 8 Stolen Books? Kill kobolds on the way north until you have them
T 91743 | Brother Paxton, in the library. Take any of the three books: no profession is needed for this route (Skinning gives a little money if you want one)
A 91745 | Brother Paxton
T 91745 | Kelsey Fargo, outside the entrance of Echo Ridge Mine
A 91752 | Kelsey Fargo. Marked as a group quest, but one kobold at a time it is done alone
C 21 | Inside the mine: kill 12 Kobold Laborers (3-4). They stand in twos: pull with Frostbolt and back up into the tunnel you already cleared
C 91752 @ Elwynn Forest, 49.1, 28.3 | Shinyfinder Narf is at the very back of the mine. Clear every kobold near him first, drink to full, then open with Frostbolt from maximum range and keep backing away while you cast. Loot the Sack of "Picture" Books. If he is too strong after two tries, press Skip on this step and the next four books steps; the rest of the route does not need them
T 21 | Marshal McBride, in the abbey
A 54 | Marshal McBride: your papers for Goldshire
T 91752 | Marshal McBride
A 91758 | Marshal McBride
A 96627 | Marshal McBride (needs level 4): the camping quest line. Sam Sarsaparilla is just before Goldshire
T 91758 | Tordrin Sternblade, by the stable behind the abbey
A 91772 | Tordrin Sternblade. He gives you a Kobold Tracking Kit
TRAIN @ Elwynn Forest, 49.7, 39.4 | Khelden Bremen: level 6 spells if you are 6 already (Fire Blast, Conjure Food, Fireball rank 2). Otherwise you train in Goldshire. Sell and repair at the wagons in front of the abbey
A 2158 | Leave the valley by the road south through the gate. Falkhaan Isenstrider stands beside the road just outside the wall
C 91772 @ Elwynn Forest, 47.8, 45.6 | Follow the kobold tracks south toward Goldshire: there are six sets, beside the road between the Northshire gate and Goldshire (the arrow leads to the first). Use the Kobold Tracking Kit from your bags at each one until 6/6. The next segment starts where the last track ends, just north of Goldshire
